    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always fascinated me, though I never pursued it deeply—my parents’ education levels made formal study less accessible. As a retired educator in economics, I find its logic and precision grounding for problem-solving, especially in analyzing data or teaching history. It’s both a tool and a puzzle that keeps my mind sharp.",
