    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’ve admired how AI tools like Wolfram Alpha or symbolic solvers simplify algebraic steps for students. For me, they’d be useful for double-checking calculations—like verifying a quadratic formula’s expansion—but I’d still prefer human explanations for intuition.",
